vusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/Track26_IndoorSchedule_1920x1080.jpg"><media:title>WVU announced the 2026-27 Indoor Track and Field Schedule.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/Track26_IndoorSchedule_1920x1080.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:23:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>16</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59755</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineer Ticket Office Announces Holiday Hours</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/23/general-mountaineer-ticket-office-announces-holiday-hours</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/23/general-mountaineer-ticket-office-announces-holiday-hours</guid><category>General</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="The exterior of Hope Coliseum at the Blue Gate entrance. " src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/22/EEN02257.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. - The Mountaineer Ticket Office has announced its hours for the upcoming Thanksgiving holiday.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/22/EEN02257.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/22/EEN02257.jpg"><media:title>The exterior of Hope Coliseum at the Blue Gate entrance. </media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/22/EEN02257.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:37:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>3</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59753</s:story_id></item><item><title>Sadler Racks Up Big 12 Weekly Accolades Again</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/23/mens-basketball-sadler-racks-up-big-12-weekly-accolades-again</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/23/mens-basketball-sadler-racks-up-big-12-weekly-accolades-again</guid><category>Men's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Miles Sadler has been named Big 12 Freshman of the Week and to the Big 12 Starting 5" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/23/MBB26_Big12WeeklyAward_1920x1080_Sadler2.png" /><br /><br />IRVING, Texas - Houston's Dedan Thomas Jr. took home Player of the Week honors after guiding the Cougars to the Players Era 8 championship while West Virginia's Miles Sadler earned Freshman of the Week recognition for his performance at the same tournament in this week's Monster Energy Big 12 Men's Basketball weekly awards.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/MBB26_Big12WeeklyAward_1920x1080_Sadler2.png" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/MBB26_Big12WeeklyAward_1920x1080_Sadler2.png"><media:title>Miles Sadler has been named Big 12 Freshman of the Week and to the Big 12 Starting 5</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/MBB26_Big12WeeklyAward_1920x1080_Sadler2.png" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:52:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59751</s:story_id></item><item><title>Vanadia, Watters to Compete at NWCA All-Star Classic</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/23/wrestling-vanadia-watters-to-compete-at-nwca-all-star-classic</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/23/wrestling-vanadia-watters-to-compete-at-nwca-all-star-classic</guid><category