<br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University Cross Country team has been named the WVU Student-Athletes of the Week, presented by University Apartments.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/crosscountry.png" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/crosscountry.png"><media:title>Cross Country team celebrates on the podium after finishing runner-up at the NCAA Championships</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/crosscountry.png" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 11:42:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>10</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59749</s:story_id></item><item><title>West Virginia Heads to the Bahamas for the Battle 4 Atlantis</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/23/womens-basketball-west-virginia-heads-to-the-bahamas-for-the-battle-4-atlantis</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/23/womens-basketball-west-virginia-heads-to-the-bahamas-for-the-battle-4-atlantis</guid><category>Women's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Khy Ngodu matchup for the battle 4 atlantis" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/23/WBB26_MATCHUP_vsFLORIDA_1920x1080.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 20-ranked West Virginia University women's basketball team heads to Paradise Island, The Bahamas, for two games at the Battle 4 Atlantis. The event runs from Nov. 24-26 with the Mountaineers playing on both Tuesday, against Florida, and Thursday, against Notre Dame, inside Imperial Hall.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/WBB26_MATCHUP_vsFLORIDA_1920x1080.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/WBB26_MATCHUP_vsFLORIDA_1920x1080.jpg"><media:title>Khy Ngodu matchup for the battle 4 atlantis</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/23/WBB26_MATCHUP_vsFLORIDA_1920x1080.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59748</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>